## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: |cffC9A24ATwich|rUI Layouts
## Notes: Layout packages for TwichUI. Loaded only when a layout is installed, checked or restored; keep it turned on alongside TwichUI.
## Author: twichie
## Version: 1.0.0
## RequiredDeps: !!!TwichUI
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\!!!TwichUI\media\icon
## X-License: MIT (code); see !!!TwichUI\LICENSE
## Category: Interface Enhancements

# docs/layouts/ has the contract. No saved variables of its own: the install record is TwichUIDB.layouts (the core's).
# Pure parts first (no game calls): the canonical form and fingerprint, the package checks, the composer
Canon.lua
Package.lua
Compose.lua

# The two adapters: TwichUI's own settings, and the EllesmereUI suite through its partner-installer functions
AdapterTwichUI.lua
AdapterEllesmere.lua

# The install record (TwichUIDB.layouts.install) and the pipeline: plan, apply, verify, restore, and the check after a reload
Journal.lua
Engine.lua

# The developer test package and /tui layout (last: it tells TwichUI the layout tools are ready)
TestPackage.lua
Dev.lua
